    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "모처럼 왔는데 박물관이 휴관이라 매우 실망했다",
      "text": "Though I came to visit the museum all the way, it was closed to my great <b>disappointment</b>."
